SELECT name,replace(name,"jo","ho"),reverse(name), repeat(concat(name," "),3)FROM EMPLOYEE ;

Output:
+----------+-------------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+
| name     | replace(name,"jo","ho") | reverse(name) | repeat(concat(name," "),3)  |
+----------+-------------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+
| Clark jo | Clark ho                | oj kralC      | Clark jo Clark jo Clark jo  |
| Dave     | Dave                    | evaD          | Dave Dave Dave              |
| Ava      | Ava                     | avA           | Ava Ava Ava                 |
+----------+-------------------------+---------------+-----------------------------+

